    "rationale": "Release 1.0.2 (Android versionCode 3) requires a new APK because the allowed-app icon feature adds StudyAppIcons.kt and changes the StudyGuard native module response. Installed v1.0.1 binaries cannot acquire that native implementation through EAS Update. The current workflow also deterministically selects apk. The iPhone viewport fix, goal controls and achievement auras ship with the same release candidate.",
    "evidence": [
